{
  "comment": "O14 — a task's work status, the Roadmap status filter's reading. Shared by pkg/board (TestTheWorkStatusMatchesTheSharedFixture) and web/src/workstatus.test.ts: the filter follows PLACEMENT — done when complete (board.Complete), else backlog when parked or placed nowhere (no date, no sprint), whatever the stage says, else in progress. A card's stage badge may still show its stage. The filter also offers locked and no-items (board.TaskStatuses, board.PlanStatuses): `matches`, where a case gives it, is every value a task answers — its work status, and locked while a dependency holds it (`locked`, the derived status.locked, not the stage) and it is not done; a case without it answers its status alone. `plans` are what a planning card answers BY ITSELF from its roll-up (status.hierarchy) and its lock: no-items when nothing is under it, locked while held and not done; it answers the rest by the tasks under it. Hide done is every value but done, so it keeps exactly what is not done.",
  "cases": [
